cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the frozen results, please cite it as below."
title: "Spatially Localized Conformal Calibration for Regional Ocean Forecasting"
abstract: >-
  Conformal calibration code and frozen evaluation results for spatially localized
  conformal prediction applied to 12-day regional ocean forecasts of five variables
  over the equatorial Pacific, comparing split conformal prediction, spatially
  adaptive conformal prediction, normalized and seasonal variants, conformalized
  quantile regression, and adaptive methods under observation-aware feedback delay.
